<title>ITALY: Albanian refugee boat reported capsized off Italy.</title>
<headline>Albanian refugee boat reported capsized off Italy.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Albanian boat capsized in heavy seas in the Adriatic on Friday and around 100 refugees were believed to be in the water with deaths reported, Italian news agencies said.</p>
<p>The ANSA agency reported that the boat capsized 35 nautical miles off the southern Italian port of Brindisi while it was being escorted by an Italian navy ship. It said two bodies had been recovered and four men rescued so far.</p>
